%% NeuroGate — Sequence: user interaction flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant H as HMI
    participant S as Sensor
    participant A as AI Engine
    participant D as Display

    U->>H: initiates action
    H->>S: reads sensor data
    S->>A: sends data payload
    A->>A: processes & predicts
    A->>D: renders result
    D-->>U: shows output